{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_61","type":"agent_message","text":"Two useful checks caught problems: releasing steering could carry the hero past the next cell, and the pen shortcut was slower than its outer detour. Both are fixed. The pen now has a measured 18-cell detour, so a planned rotation can save travel. The expanded simulation suite passes.\n"}}
