 simulation time can lag wall time, stretching title idle beyond ten seconds. | Native Arcade idle is retained with a monotonic wall-clock deadline. Verification follows. |\n\nA test fixture that accidentally opened a connected cell was corrected to isolate a floor cell. Browser tests now wait for actual input ticks and disambiguate native/content Back buttons. These test-harness corrections are not counted as game issues. Seed roundtrip and seam coordinates were improved during source review and are covered by regression checks.\nEOF\nnode tools/build.mjs\nnode tools/test.mjs --browser\"","aggregated_output":"FAIL browser suite completed: Page.wait_for_function: Timeout 4000ms exceeded.\n29 passed, 1 failed, 0 skipped\n","exit_code":1,"status":"failed"}}
